<speak>My <sub alias="eff eye en">FIN</sub> is <sub alias="tee">T</sub> eight four six three seven four four <sub alias="aitch">H</sub>. My date of birth is the fourth of August nineteen ninety-six. I'm speaking from home, so I have the papers to hand and can talk privately. I had considered calling from the office, but people tend to knock on the door there even when they know I'm on the telephone.</speak>